    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relictor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relictor</strong> is a strategy game with elements of survival and exploration set in a post-apocalyptic world. Manage a mobile base that moves across dangerous terrains, create and control high-tech modules, explore the devastated world, and defend yourself against numerous threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Relictor</strong>, you will control a shuttle whose engines have failed, causing it to move slowly across the ravaged land. Onboard the base is a replicator that creates &quot;external modules&quot;\u2014small machines with artificial intelligence capable of performing various tasks. These modules can be tanks, robots, wheeled vehicles, and gliders that engage in combat, gather resources, and explore anomalies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Control in Tactical Battles:</strong> Stop time and use strategy to plan attacks and maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenging for Parts and Artifacts:</strong> Find wreckage on the battlefield, extract valuable components and artifacts, and build unique units in the constructor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Modules:</strong> Give your modules autonomy or control them manually. Develop them by upgrading their weapons and equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research and Resource Gathering:</strong> Discover new territories, find resources, and locate anomalies that will help you survive and develop your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy and Trade:</strong> Encounter various beings, fight, or strike deals to gain advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modifications and Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your modules, unlock new capabilities, and acquire new gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relictor</strong> is a game where you will need to survive, explore, and build your future in a devastated world filled with dangers and mysteries.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relictor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relictor</strong> is a strategy game with elements of survival and exploration set in a post-apocalyptic world. Manage a mobile base that moves across dangerous terrains, create and control high-tech modules, explore the devastated world, and defend yourself against numerous threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Relictor</strong>, you will control a shuttle whose engines have failed, causing it to move slowly across the ravaged land. Onboard the base is a replicator that creates &quot;external modules&quot;\u2014small machines with artificial intelligence capable of performing various tasks. These modules can be tanks, robots, wheeled vehicles, and gliders that engage in combat, gather resources, and explore anomalies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Control in Tactical Battles:</strong> Stop time and use strategy to plan attacks and maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenging for Parts and Artifacts:</strong> Find wreckage on the battlefield, extract valuable components and artifacts, and build unique units in the constructor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Modules:</strong> Give your modules autonomy or control them manually. Develop them by upgrading their weapons and equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research and Resource Gathering:</strong> Discover new territories, find resources, and locate anomalies that will help you survive and develop your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy and Trade:</strong> Encounter various beings, fight, or strike deals to gain advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modifications and Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your modules, unlock new capabilities, and acquire new gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relictor</strong> is a game where you will need to survive, explore, and build your future in a devastated world filled with dangers and mysteries.</p>",
    "short_description": "Relictor is a strategy game set in a post-apocalyptic world. Manage a mobile base. Create AI-driven modules like tanks and gliders for exploration, resource gathering, and tactical battles. Survive, trade, and uncover mysteries in a dangerous world.",
