        "notes": "The game contains violence and the destruction of various enemies, including zombies, meta-humans, and humanoid creatures. While there are no graphic depictions of blood or torture, defeated enemies immediately collapse into a darkened form, from which resources can be harvested, similar to mechanics in other grind-focused games. There is no death animation or explicit portrayal of suffering. The game also features infected fauna, including arachnid-like creatures. Additionally, there are no sexual themes, nudity, or sexual content, though some enemies, such as zombies, may be depicted without clothing."
